            {"question":"During the period before the mid-1800s, the orientation of care was primarily:","options":["Preventive","Population-focused","Curative","Wellness-focused"],"answer":"Curative"},
            {"question":"Which individual was identified as the first person to use the term public health nursing?","options":["Ruth Freedman","William Rathbone","Lilliam Wald","St. Phoebe"],"answer":"Lilliam Wald"},
            {"question":"Community health includes:","options":["Only diseases affecting community members","Only health services available in hospitals","Health status, health problems, and health care provided for the community","Individual nursing diagnosis only"],"answer":"Health status, health problems, and health care provided for the community"},
            {"question":"Which sequence BEST represents the direction of deterioration in the spectrum of health?","options":["Death → complications → clinical disease → optimal health","Optimal health → positive health → negative health → clinical disease → complications → death","Positive health → optimal health → complications → death","Clinical disease → negative health → positive health → death"],"answer":"Optimal health → positive health → negative health → clinical disease → complications → death"},
