            {"question":"Education and occupation may influence community health mainly through their effect on:","options":["Disease diagnosis only","Behavior, attitudes, and exposure to health hazards","Geographic location only","Mortality only"],"answer":"Behavior, attitudes, and exposure to health hazards"},
