            {"question":"A pregnant woman receives TT3 at least 6 months after TT2. The expected protection is:","options":["No protection","3 years","5 years","Lifetime protection"],"answer":"5 years"},
            {"question":"Which statement is CORRECT regarding TT4?","options":["It is given at least 1 year after TT3 and provides 10 years of protection","It is given 4 weeks after TT1 and provides 3 years of protection","It provides lifetime protection immediately after TT1","It is replaced by rabies immunoglobulin"],"answer":"It is given at least 1 year after TT3 and provides 10 years of protection"},
